1
00:01:50,039 --> 00:01:52,300
I will love Sophie until death do us part.

2
00:01:58,039 --> 00:01:59,840
My mother-in-law gave me the words,

3
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:00,960
and Sophie gave me love.

4
00:02:00,960 --> 00:02:02,080
I don't care.

5
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:03,880
I just want to be properly

6
00:02:04,320 --> 00:02:05,760
loved enough for once.

7
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:09,960
Being loved might not be enough.

8
00:02:10,600 --> 00:02:12,530
You have to love someone properly.

9
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:15,640
If you dare not to love me,

10
00:02:15,920 --> 00:02:17,040
I will kill you.

11
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:50,040
For so many years,

12
00:02:50,040 --> 00:02:51,480
besides Mara,

13
00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:53,720
maybe only Zhiwei

14
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:56,240
has truly treated me as...

15
00:02:56,240 --> 00:02:57,920
A respectable

16
00:02:58,240 --> 00:02:59,840
and thoughtful person.

17
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:03,720
Only I know in my heart

18
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:07,520
that a heart riddled with scars

19
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:12,120
is incapable of loving someone wholeheartedly.

20
00:03:14,040 --> 00:03:15,800
Don't be afraid.

21
00:03:16,160 --> 00:03:16,800
I'm here.

22
00:03:19,160 --> 00:03:20,280
Can you

23
00:03:22,040 --> 00:03:23,720
never leave me?

24
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:29,040
Please don't leave me.

25
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:30,160
I won't.

26
00:03:33,480 --> 00:03:34,480
Don't leave me.

27
00:03:35,320 --> 00:03:36,920
Please don't leave me.

28
00:03:36,920 --> 00:03:37,920
I won't leave you.

29
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:44,180
I was wrong.

30
00:03:54,760 --> 00:03:57,490
I thought fate could be restarted again and again

31
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:00,680
to cover up my selfishness,

32
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:01,840
cowardice,

33
00:04:03,040 --> 00:04:03,840
vanity,

34
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:06,060
and indifference.

35
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:11,210
I didn't have the courage to save Mala,

36
00:04:12,640 --> 00:04:15,100
afraid the bullying would be directed at me.

37
00:04:18,279 --> 00:04:21,140
I was too ashamed to admit Xiaotao's idea was great,

38
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:25,170
and that my inspiration came from him.

39
00:04:29,640 --> 00:04:31,640
I didn't insist on going with Lao Dai

40
00:04:32,640 --> 00:04:34,200
to make the fairest deal.

41
00:04:36,159 --> 00:04:38,360
I didn't have the guts to stand with An An

42
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:40,020
and face the future together.

43
00:04:42,960 --> 00:04:44,820
I didn't have the courage to admit

44
00:04:44,880 --> 00:04:47,610
that my feelings for you over the past three years

45
00:04:49,080 --> 00:04:51,240
didn't stem from my guilt towards Mala

46
00:04:52,400 --> 00:04:53,200
and fear.

47
00:04:55,960 --> 00:04:56,840
I'm sorry.

48
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:09,960
Actually, I hate

49
00:05:10,160 --> 00:05:12,280
apologizing and crying the most.

50
00:05:12,880 --> 00:05:14,120
They make you feel

51
00:05:14,640 --> 00:05:16,120
so incompetent.

52
00:05:19,480 --> 00:05:20,400
But this time,

53
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:25,880
I don't hate it.

54
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:04,120
I never want to

55
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:06,760
look for love

56
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:08,600
in anyone else anymore.

57
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:12,760
From now on,

58
00:06:14,840 --> 00:06:17,400
I want to start loving myself properly.

59
00:06:43,560 --> 00:06:45,000
Stop crying.

60
00:06:45,320 --> 00:06:46,520
It will get infected.

61
00:06:47,360 --> 00:06:48,360
You'll get ugly.

62
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:54,720
I want to live happily.

63
00:06:56,960 --> 00:06:58,920
But it seems happiness

64
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:02,400
is out of my control.

65
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:06,240
As long as you've loved with all your heart,

66
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:08,600
that's enough.

67
00:07:16,960 --> 00:07:20,120
The person who invented the word 'love' is truly great.

68
00:07:20,720 --> 00:07:22,080
Desire,

69
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:23,520
arguments,

70
00:07:23,520 --> 00:07:24,560
punishment,

71
00:07:25,080 --> 00:07:26,080
reconciliation.

72
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:27,400
Happiness.

73
00:07:29,000 --> 00:07:30,930
Anything can be justified by love.

74
00:07:31,880 --> 00:07:32,880
Since childhood,

75
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:36,900
everyone loves reading the stories of Cinderella and Snow White,

76
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:38,260
thinking that is love.

77
00:07:39,080 --> 00:07:40,960
It seems only people like them

78
00:07:41,159 --> 00:07:42,480
deserve to be loved.

79
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:45,200
What about Cinderella's stepsisters?

80
00:07:45,200 --> 00:07:47,260
What about Snow White's stepmother?

81
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:49,520
They are just pitiful people

82
00:07:49,520 --> 00:07:52,080
who don't know what love looks like.

83
00:07:52,840 --> 00:07:55,240
They also deserve to be the main characters

84
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:57,240
and have their own stories.

85
00:08:28,200 --> 00:08:29,460
I've always wondered,

86
00:08:29,840 --> 00:08:31,960
the moment I finally met Mara,

87
00:08:32,520 --> 00:08:33,450
what I would say.

88
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:36,970
I remembered the first sci-fi story I ever wrote.

89
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:38,840
It was just one short sentence.

90
00:08:39,919 --> 00:08:42,200
The last man on Earth sat alone in a room.

91
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:45,080
Then, there was a knock on the door.

92
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:47,880
He opened the door and said,

93
00:08:48,560 --> 00:08:49,760
"What a coincidence.

94
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:51,080
You're here too."

95
00:08:52,400 --> 00:08:55,060
It's said that since humans invented language,

96
00:08:55,120 --> 00:08:57,560
it's the most widely used greeting,

97
00:08:58,320 --> 00:09:00,980
capable of handling any unexpected situation.

98
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,200
I never thought

99
00:09:02,400 --> 00:09:03,880
I'd use it to face death.

100
00:09:04,560 --> 00:09:07,840
If I end up trapped in the cracks of an endless loop,

101
00:09:08,640 --> 00:09:10,300
we are destined to meet again.

102
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:44,250
What a coincidence.

103
00:09:46,520 --> 00:09:47,840
You're here too.
